    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/alve33/Radium-Download-Manager/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>radium download-manager downloader http hls dash bittorrent ftp win32</tags>
    <summary>Fast, native Windows 10 / 11 download manager with multi-connection acceleration and HLS/DASH stream capture.</summary>
    <description>Radium Download Manager is a lightweight, native C++20 and Win32 download manager for Windows 10 / 11.
It combines an in-process HTTP/HTTPS segmented download engine with dynamic connection spawning and work-stealing range reuse, BitTorrent and FTP support, an out-of-process HLS/DASH stream pipeline (N_m3u8DL-RE and FFmpeg), and a Manifest V3 browser extension via Native Messaging.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/alve33/Radium-Download-Manager/releases/tag/v2.0.0</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
